{"id":"01a046af-924b-7c54-ae70-78c647c3d634","issue_id":"project-LICHEN-worker6-2hss.4","event_type":"closed","actor":"Mark Atwood","old_value":"","new_value":"Hop limit validation against MAX_HOP_LIMIT is already implemented in both Rreq::from_bytes (lines 402-404) and Rrep::from_bytes (lines 467-469). Both parsers check if the hop value exceeds MAX_HOP_LIMIT (15) and return LoadngError::HopLimitExceeded if so. Four tests verify this behavior: rreq_hop_limit_above_max_rejected, rrep_hop_count_above_max_rejected, rreq_hop_limit_boundaries_accepted, and rrep_hop_count_boundaries_accepted.","created_at":"2026-08-28T04:45:06.507809Z"}
